        <mxCell id="card_sovereignty_notes" value="Legal &amp; Compliance Safeguards:&#10;• Transfer of Colombian agricultural data to USA is submitted to the Federation under Question Q-02 and PD-101.&#10;• Personal Data Isolation: Stored in personal-data table encrypted with KMS personal; no inference function role holds this key.&#10;• Bedrock Terms: Amazon Bedrock does not use customer prompts or completions to train base foundation models." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=22;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
