        <mxCell id="card_matrix_notes" value="Idempotency Mechanics (Section 6.3):&#10;• Drone Functions: result_id = {function}#{mission_id}. Conditional put prevents duplicate result; transaction verifies source state.&#10;• Telemetry Function: result_id = {node_id}#{variable}#{reading_timestamp}. Conditional put prevents duplicate episode opening.&#10;• SQS Dead-Letter Redrive: Safe to redrive at any time; duplicate event finds existing result and deletes itself without calling model." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=22;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="960" y="2015" width="1040" height="290" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="panel_citations" value="IaC TRACEABILITY, HARVEST VOLUMES &amp; CITATIONS (Sections 9, 11, 13, 14)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=25;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2040" y="1610" width="720" height="710" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="card_iac_boxes" value="Track B / IaC Box Traceability (docs/architecture.md Section 14)&#10;• D10 (#30 / B10): Event-Driven Inference Function Pattern&#10;  Coded pattern of Epic 6: SQS threshold queue, Lambda rules engine, Alert Store, SNS topic, Bedrock plausibility check, DLQs.&#10;• D09 (#29 / B09): Telemetry Ingestion Pattern Module (ADR-003)&#10;  AWS IoT Core, topic rules, DynamoDB telemetry table, IoT rule error SQS queue.&#10;• D06 (#26 / B06): Identities &amp; KMS Customer Keys&#10;  IAM Lambda execution roles (least privilege), KMS keys: records, telemetry, objects, logs, restricted.&#10;  (Note: D04 is omitted because inference functions are not VPC-attached)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingLeft=22;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2055" y="1655" width="690" height="175" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="card_harvest_volumes" value="Harvest Volume &amp; Spend Drivers (Section 9 | ASM-168, ASM-169)&#10;• Telemetry: 108,000 readings/harvest month (200 farms x 6/day + 100 farms x 24/day); Bedrock called ONLY on episode openings.&#10;• Confirmation: ~1/alert; up to 8 focus photos.&#10;• Verification: ~1/fumigation; up to 8 short-pass frames.&#10;• Estimation: 200 flights/campaign (1/farm/harvest campaign); up to 20 plot photos + 1 plot map.&#10;• Cost Controls: On-demand Bedrock (zero idle compute), idempotency avoids re-invocation, image caps enforce predictable token budgets." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingLeft=22;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2055" y="1840" width="690" height="185" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="card_decision_citations" value="Normative Decision-Log Citations (docs/decision-log.md)&#10;• ASM-160 (Bedrock Nova Pro us-east-1)   • ASM-161 (Delivery paths &amp; SQS decoupling)&#10;• ASM-162 (Failure parameters &amp; backoff)     • ASM-163 (0.70 confidence threshold)&#10;• ASM-164 (On-device person detector)        • ASM-165 (Restricted prefix &amp; key)&#10;• ASM-166 (Estimation formula &amp; factors)    • ASM-167 (Telemetry plausibility on openings)&#10;• ASM-168 (Image caps per invocation)        • ASM-169 (Named pricing parameters for A23)&#10;• PD-013 (Closed: Region &amp; Colombia exit)   • PD-014 (Closed: Retries, DLQ &amp; observation)&#10;• PD-015 (Closed: Person object handling)    • PD-111 (Closed: Persisted object trigger)&#10;• PD-112 (Closed: Telemetry store coupling)  • PD-135 (Closed: A14 evaluation contract)&#10;• PD-161 (Closed: B10 telemetry pattern)     • PD-018 (Open: AWS live feature re-check)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#64748b;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingLeft=22;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2055" y="2035" width="690" height="270" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

